      "description": "Exceptional Cardiology Care for Dogs and Cats in Dallas - Ft. Worth  Your pet is a part of your family, and we understand that facing a medical difficulty can be stressful. You can rely on our compassionate, expert team to make the process as easy as possible, and you’ll get updates each step of the way to put your mind at ease.   MedVet Grapevine serves as an extension of your family veterinarian should your pet need specialty veterinary care. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet for a healthy heart and lungs. We value open communication with you and your family veterinarian so we can all partner together to provide the best care for your pet so they can have a longer, more active life.  ",
